	</row>

	<row id="TRID_ELITEW_20_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE">
		<language name="JPN" width="216">たかい　ところ……
ほんとうは　にがて　なのよー！</language>
		<language name="JPN_KANJI" width="216">高い　ところ……
